// Title: Suspicious Reconnaissance Activity Using Get-LocalGroupMember Cmdlet
// ID: c8a180d6-47a3-4345-a609-53f9c3d834fc
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-10-10
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1087.001
// Description: Detects suspicious reconnaissance command line activity on Windows systems using the PowerShell Get-LocalGroupMember Cmdlet
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Get-LocalGroupMember ")) AND ((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "domain admins") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " administrator") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " administrateur") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "enterprise admins") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Exchange Trusted Subsystem") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Remote Desktop Users") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Utilisateurs du Bureau à distance") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Usuarios de escritorio remoto"))))
